# Ack watermark operations
name: ack-watermark
version: 1
description: Ack watermark set persists across reboot; injected and out-of-range acks fail without moving the cursor.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
read CHIP-003
assert ack_watermark 0
expect_ack 2 true
assert last_ack true
assert ack_watermark 2
fail_watermark_next
expect_ack 3 false
assert last_ack false
assert ack_watermark 2
expect_ack 3 true
assert ack_watermark 3
reboot
assert ack_watermark 3
expect_ack 99 false
assert ack_watermark 3
